WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.769
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.037
everybody.
You're here, you made it.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:07.507
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.209
Well, guys, today
is the one-year anniversary

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.678
of the January 6th riot
at the Capitol.

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:15.047
President Biden marked the day
with a speech,

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:17.316
and he really unloaded on Trump.
Listen to this.

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.685
-He's not just
a former president,

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:23.022
he's a defeated
former president.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:28.361
Defeated by a margin of
over 7 million of your votes,

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:32.599
in a full and free and fair
election.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.869
-Yeah. Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:39.538
Biden -- Biden
is not messing around there.

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:41.106
I know that vibe.
I know that vibe.

00:00:41.106 --> 00:00:43.943
That's "high school principal
after a food fight" vibe.

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.845
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:46.979
They just rub it in.
Biden was like,

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.281
"I would have DM'd you,

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.716
but I couldn't find you
on Twitter."

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.317
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.519
Alright.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:55.521
Let's switch gears.
This is a fun story.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.124
Pope Francis just held
his weekly general audience,

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.992
where he gets to
greet and meet people

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.261
and go out in the public.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.895
And he was treated
to a very special performance.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.130
Take a look at this.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.233
[ Up-tempo music plays ]

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:14.040
♪♪

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.142
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.311
[ Applause ]
-That's real. That is real.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:21.447
That's -- That's -- [ Laughs ]

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.049
That's his reaction, yeah, yeah.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.785
Yeah, that's the treat
for the pope.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.019
Right after that,
he asked for a gong.

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.355
[ Laughter ]
Like, "Oh, oh."

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.658
[ Gong clangs ]

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.326
Now, the pope's
New Year's resolution is

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:36.528
to say no to more stuff.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.528 --> 00:01:38.097
For this, as a result,

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.565
the pope was just given
a new job.

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:40.733
Look at this.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.402
[ Up-tempo music plays ]

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:44.904
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.673
[ Laughter ]
-He didn't like it.

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:48.875
He didn't like it.
-It's what he's there for.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:51.644
-Cracking -- Cracking walnuts.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.614
Did you guys see this BMW car?

00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:58.551
They just unveiled a new SUV
that can actually change colors.

00:01:58.551 --> 00:02:00.419
Real. Watch this.

00:02:00.419 --> 00:02:03.055
Ooh. It's real.

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:08.027
-[ Speaking indistinctly ]
-Oh.

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.629
-Wow.
-[ Speaking indistinctly ]

00:02:10.629 --> 00:02:12.932
-Yeah, yeah, experts say
it's gonna revolutionize

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.601
the way you forget
where you parked your car.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:15.802
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:19.272
"Honey, are we driving
a white SUV, or..."

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:20.672
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.672 --> 00:02:22.242
Now, police are gonna be like,
"In pursuit of a black --

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.243
wait, silver --
no, wait -- a red --

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.513
Damn it!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:28.748
Well, get this.
So, Kohler just unveiled

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.584
its new stillness bath
that emits fog

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.686
to replicate a spa experience.

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:35.120
Look at this thing.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:37.690
Ooh.
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.525
To make it even more spa-like,

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:41.961
the bath also emits a hologram
of a naked old guy

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.596
who's just two feet away
from you.

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.064
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.700
And finally, Taco Bell just
launched a subscription service

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.803 line:60%
that sends customers a taco
every day for a month.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.505 line:64%
-Oh!

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.839
-Well, it looks like
we're about to go through

00:02:53.839 --> 00:02:56.109
another toilet paper shortage.
We have a great show.

